Description: Draws the standard normal curve with score scales lined up under it: z, T,
    cumulative percentage, percentile, sten, stanine, grade and IQ, or scales defined in a
    data frame, each shown as labelled tick marks or coloured bands, in blues, reds, greens
    or a diverging palette, each with a light and a dark mode.
